    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.identityVerificationRequired": `Registration may need identity checks, such as your address, email, phone number, or a government-issued ID.`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.requiresCpfOrCnpj": `To register: you must be an individual with a valid CPF (Cadastro de Pessoas Físicas) number or a company/organization with a valid CNPJ (Cadastro Nacional da Pessoa Jurídica) number`,
