    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.requiresIdNumber": `To register: individuals must provide personal ID number, organizations: organization ID number`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.openRegistration": `Anyone can register as long as registrant name and contact information are valid, up-to-date, and meet the standards set by the Registry`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.requiresAustralianId": `Registration is limited to commercial entities with valid Australian Eligibility ID Number`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.ponpesIdLegalDocuments": `For the .ponpes.id domain extension, the following legal documents must be prepared: A scanned copy of the ID card of the Person in Charge. A letter of introduction from the school principal of the Islamic boarding school (pondok) or institution`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.schIdLegalDocuments": `For the .sch.id domain extension, the following legal documents must be prepared: A scanned copy of the ID card of the School Principal/Person in Charge. A scanned copy of the application letter from the School Principal. A scanned copy of the Power of Attorney from the School Principal to the Person in Charge for registering the domain name (This is optional if you provide the ID card of the Person in Charge). A scanned copy of the Decree of Establishment from the Ministry or SKPD (only for non-formal schools)`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.orIdLegalDocuments": `For the .or.id domain extension, the following legal documents must be prepared: A scanned copy of the ID card of the institution's leader. A scanned copy of the Notarial Deed or the organization's internal decree (SK)`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.webIdLegalDocuments": `For the .web.id domain extension, the following legal documents must be prepared: A scanned copy of the ID card of the Person in Charge (must be valid)`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.coIdLegalDocuments": `For the .co.id domain extension, the following legal documents must be prepared: A scanned copy of the SIUP/TDP or Notarial Deed (cover of the first page and the company's NPWP). A scanned copy of the Trademark Ownership Certificate (if available)`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.acIdLegalDocuments": `For the .ac.id domain extension, the following legal documents must be prepared: A scanned copy of the ID card of the Rector/Head of Institution/Person in Charge. A scanned copy of an official application letter from the Rector/Head of Institution. A scanned copy of the Ministry of Education decree establishing the institution. A scanned copy of the Notarial Deed of Establishment or Rector's Decree (Institution Leader). A scanned copy of the Power of Attorney from the Institution Leader to the person in charge of domain registration (This is optional if you include the ID card of the Person in Charge).`,
    "components.domainSearch.restrictions.v2.itLegalDocuments": `.it domains can be registered by individuals of legal age who are EEA, Swiss, Vatican, or San Marino citizens/residents, or by organizations headquartered there.`,
