    "feature-list.tooltip.free-branded-email-boxes": `Grow your business with a professional email. Create mailboxes that match your domain, each with 1 GB of storage. Need more? Upgrade anytime for extra space or more accounts. (e.g. you{'@'}yourdomain.com)`,
