    "feature-list.tooltip.ssh-access": `Use SSH to protect your communication with the remote server. It provides a secure encrypted connection to your account to easily manage massive files and even databases. It serves to administrators and web developers to enable direct secure access to their hosting account on the web server. With SSH enabled, you can also take advantage of SFTP for secure file access, transfer, and management.`,
    "feature-list.tooltip.cloudflare-protected-nameservers": `Shield your DNS infrastructure from DDoS attacks. Cloudflare DNS firewall protects our nameservers, and it has the same DDoS protection that has mitigated some of the largest DDoS attacks to date. When malicious traffic is aimed at our origin nameservers, Cloudflare’s DDoS protection reroutes that traffic and absorbs it across global networks. That means your website will be available and traffic continues to flow, even when your origin nameservers are compromised.`,
    "feature-list.tooltip.cloudflare-protected-nameservers-minimal": `With Cloudflare Protected Nameservers, you can be sure that your website's information is in safe hands. Cloudflare ensures these records stay safe and intact, shields your website from DDoS attacks, and improves its speed.`,
    "feature-list.tooltip.uptime-guarantee": `Maximize your presence online. We keep our annual uptime rates at a 99.9% height to ensure accessibility of your website at all times. When your website’s down, that’s a potentially missed opportunity to engage with a customer (or potential customer). That’s why we guarantee you one of the best service uptimes globally.`,
    "feature-list.tooltip.uptime-guarantee-minimal": `Our 99.9% uptime guarantee means your website is always available.`,
