    "feature-list.tooltip.advanced-anti-virus": `Enhanced protection of your inbox to ensure incoming attachments are free from viruses, malware, phishing attacks, and more.`,
    "feature-list.tooltip.imap-pop3-support": `Titan supports all email protocols to ensure smooth delivery of your emails so you can access them on third-party applications such as Gmail, Outlook, or Thunderbird.`,
    "feature-list.tooltip.catch-all-account": `All undelivered emails to your domain are routed to the catch-all mailbox so you don’t miss important communication sent to invalid addresses.`,
